	"final_summary" : "Codec.java: It is a public interface.\nTest.java: facade: Test acts as a facade for subsystem VideoConversionFacade, which main calls convertVideo method of VideoConversionFacade. It is a public class. The only method of Test is main (void). No methods call main and main calls only one method : convertVideo method of class VideoConversionFacade.\n\n\nOggCompressionCodec.java: It is a public class that implements Codec.\nVideoConversionFacade.java: facade: VideoConversionFacade acts as a subsystem for facade Test, which main method of Test calls convertVideo. VideoConversionFacade acts as a facade for subsystem CodecFactory, AudioMixer, BitrateReader, which convertVideo calls extract method of CodecFactory, read method of BitrateReader, convert method of BitrateReader, fix method of AudioMixer. It is a public class. The only method of VideoConversionFacade is convertVideo (File). Only one method ( main method of class Test ) calls convertVideo and convertVideo calls 4 methods : read method of class BitrateReader, extract method of class CodecFactory, convert method of class BitrateReader and fix method of class AudioMixer.\n\n\nVideoFile.java: facade: VideoFile acts as a subsystem for facade CodecFactory, which extract method of CodecFactory calls getCodecType. It is a public class. The 2 methods of VideoFile are getCodecType (String) and getName (String). Only one method ( extract method of class CodecFactory ) calls getCodecType and getCodecType calls no methods. No methods call getName and getName calls no methods.\n\n\nAudioMixer.java: facade: AudioMixer acts as a subsystem for facade VideoConversionFacade, which convertVideo method of VideoConversionFacade calls fix. It is a public class. The only method of AudioMixer is fix (File). Only one method ( convertVideo method of class VideoConversionFacade ) calls fix and fix calls no methods.\n\n\nCodecFactory.java: facade: CodecFactory acts as a facade for subsystem VideoFile, which extract calls getCodecType method of VideoFile. CodecFactory acts as a subsystem for facade VideoConversionFacade, which convertVideo method of VideoConversionFacade calls extract. It is a public class. The only method of CodecFactory is extract (Codec). Only one method ( convertVideo method of class VideoConversionFacade ) calls extract and extract calls only one method : getCodecType method of class VideoFile.\n\n\nMPEG4CompressionCodec.java: It is a public class that implements Codec.\nBitrateReader.java: facade: BitrateReader acts as a subsystem for facade VideoConversionFacade, which convertVideo method of VideoConversionFacade calls read, which convertVideo method of VideoConversionFacade calls convert. It is a public class. The 2 methods of BitrateReader are read (VideoFile) and convert (VideoFile). Only one method ( convertVideo method of class VideoConversionFacade ) calls read and read calls no methods. Only one method ( convertVideo method of class VideoConversionFacade ) calls convert and convert calls no methods.\n\n\n",
